WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:06.800
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a Chinese action thriller film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Kung Fu Jungle”. Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:22.320
In the opening scene, a martial arts expert&nbsp;
named Mo walks into the police station. His&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:27.920
face is covered in bruises and cuts that surprise&nbsp;
the officers. When asked what happened, he answers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:33.600
that he just killed somebody. The officers quickly&nbsp;
call the higher officials and arrest him. It turns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.960
out that Mo was fighting an opponent in the ring&nbsp;
and involuntarily killed him during the match. Mo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:44.080
knew that what he did was wrong, even though it&nbsp;
was accidental. Hence, he turned himself in.
&nbsp;

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:49.120
The scene cuts to three years later. A police&nbsp;
detective named Luk has been called to investigate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:54.640
a murder crime scene. She is informed that the&nbsp;
person who died was a boxer. At first glance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.640 --> 00:01:00.480
a forensic doctor notices broken ribs and limbs,&nbsp;
and blood clots around the eyes. Detective Luk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:05.200
assumes that the victim must have been tortured&nbsp;
for several days to be that severely injured.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:10.080
But by the nature of the injuries, the doctor&nbsp;
claims the victim probably got into a fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:15.840
with someone very skilled. They also notice a&nbsp;
strange dagger lying on the crime scene. 
&nbsp;

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:20.880
Somewhere else in the penitentiary, Mo has been&nbsp;
living peacefully for the past three years.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:26.640
He is often ordered around by a group of inmates.&nbsp;
With his skills, Mo can easily teach them a lesson&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:31.600
but he chooses to avoid any kind of argument.&nbsp;
The news of the death makes it to the television&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:36.800
and catches Mo’s attention. He watches the&nbsp;
broadcast in shock, almost as if he knows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:41.840
something about the murder. Immediately after, he&nbsp;
runs to the guard and asks him to call detective&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:45.920
Luk. The guard sarcastically questions&nbsp;
him about what else he would like to have.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:50.800
Mo tries explaining that he knows something about&nbsp;
the recent murder case but is dismissed. 
&nbsp;

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:55.040
Following that, he picks a fight with a group&nbsp;
of inmates. The leader of the group manages to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.040 --> 00:02:00.000
hit him on the head with a metal plate but Mo&nbsp;
dodges the second attack and breaks both of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.360
arms. By now, they are surrounded by policemen&nbsp;
who take them under custody. The prison warden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:10.560
knows that Mo is not normally a violent person.&nbsp;
Hence, he calls detective Luk and arranges a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:15.920
meeting between them. Mo finally meets her and&nbsp;
claims that the person who died was his former&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:22.160
friend who he once fought and defeated. By the&nbsp;
nature of the murder, Mo is sure that the killer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:27.280
is about to go on a killing spree. He isn’t&nbsp;
looking for revenge or money, he wants to fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:32.800
with the best kung fu fighters, fair and square.&nbsp;
When asked how he is so sure, Mo fails to provide&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:38.080
a definite answer but claims that if they set&nbsp;
him free, he can help them find the killer. 
&nbsp;

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:42.720
The detectives assume he is making things up to&nbsp;
get out of prison. As they are about to leave,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:48.080
Mo recites seven names and declares that&nbsp;
one of them is going to be the next victim.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:53.280
The names are of the fighters who he has fought&nbsp;
and defeated over the years. Detective Luk doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:57.920
believe him but she still asks her junior to&nbsp;
collect information on all seven people. 
&nbsp;

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:01.520
Then, we see the murderer sharpening&nbsp;
a dagger and writing the name&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:06.880
King Yi on the wall. King Yi is one of the&nbsp;
people that Mo mentioned earlier. He works&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:11.360
in an art museum and is currently working&nbsp;
on a sculpture of a giant human skeleton.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:16.400
When he is alone in the showroom, the killer&nbsp;
suddenly appears on top of the skull and shows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:23.040
his face for the first time. He introduces himself&nbsp;
as Yu-Sau and challenges King Yi to a battle.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:27.840
They fight each other on the top of the&nbsp;
skeleton when King Yi notices that Yu-Sau’s legs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:32.320
are different lengths. He is wearing a shoe&nbsp;
with a bigger sole to balance himself. 
&nbsp;

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:38.400
They fight using only their legs but still show&nbsp;
great expertise. Eventually, Yu-Sau traps his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:44.240
opponent’s leg between his and breaks it. Some&nbsp;
seconds later, he walks away leaving King Yi’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:49.680
dead body behind. Back in the police station, the&nbsp;
detective studies the profiles of the seven names&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:55.280
provided by Mo but finds no similarity in them.&nbsp;
All of them live simple lives in different parts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.280 --> 00:04:01.040
of the city. However, Mo’s past seems interesting&nbsp;
to her. It is revealed that he formed a famous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:06.160
martial arts club and was a teacher before his&nbsp;
imprisonment. The club has thousands of followers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:11.200
in the present day. He was also recruited by the&nbsp;
Hong Kong police as a martial art instructor.
&nbsp;

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:15.120
As the detectives talk, they get&nbsp;
the news about King Yi’s death.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:20.240
Detective Luk is shocked that Mo’s prediction&nbsp;
turned out to be true. The very next day, Mo is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:25.360
let out of the prison temporarily under police&nbsp;
custody. By inspecting the order of killings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:30.480
Mo has realized that the killer is targeting his&nbsp;
victims by following a martial arts practice.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:36.800
First, he killed the boxer who used his hands,&nbsp;
then King Yi who used his legs to fight, so his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:44.240
next target will probably be someone who wrestles.&nbsp;
Mo knows a wrestler among the remaining six people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:49.520
but Yu-Sau goes to the man before the police.
When the police arrive at the location,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:55.200
they see the wrestler's body being thrown from a&nbsp;
window. He also has a similar dagger stabbed to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.200 --> 00:05:01.680
his arm. Suddenly, Mo looks at the roof of another&nbsp;
building and sees Yu-Sau. His evil smile makes him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:07.120
realize that he is the murderer. Mo immediately&nbsp;
follows the man while the police do the same. A&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:12.640
few minutes into the chase, Yu-Sau takes a leap to&nbsp;
the top of a neighboring building and disappears,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:16.960
leaving Mo and the police ashamed that they&nbsp;
couldn’t catch him. Taking the opportunity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:21.440
Mo also escapes from police custody. 
The next day, he goes to his hometown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:26.800
Foshan where he meets his wife Sinn Ying. They&nbsp;
are happy to be reunited after three years.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:35.520
She takes him home and makes him wear a sacred&nbsp;
band on his wrist. It is supposed to make him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:40.720
fight only for self-defense and protect him from&nbsp;
making the same mistake that got him imprisoned.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:46.000
At night, Mo finds the killer’s dagger&nbsp;
in one of the boxes with his belongings.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:50.320
Sinn Ying reveals that a few months ago,&nbsp;
a limping man came to their martial arts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:54.400
school and asked her to keep the dagger. She&nbsp;
thinks that the town’s historian might know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:59.200
what the symbol in the dagger means and the&nbsp;
two decide to go to him the next day. Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:04.960
a flashback shows us Yu-Sau with his late wife&nbsp;
who had cancer. She was the only person in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:09.760
world who loved and accepted him as he is.&nbsp;
While she was dying, he practiced martial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:14.320
arts day and night to keep himself from&nbsp;
thinking about her inevitable death. 
&nbsp;

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:19.520
Back in the present, Mo and Sinn Ying go to the&nbsp;
historian to find out more about the dagger. It is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:24.480
revealed that the symbol on it is called Eaves&nbsp;
Swallo. During the rule of the Qing dynasty,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:28.560
it was given to the person who lost in a&nbsp;
martial art fight. The couple is talking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:33.840
about Yu-Sau when a man nearby overhears&nbsp;
them and claims to know him. He says that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:39.520
a few years ago Yu-Sau lived with his cancerous&nbsp;
wife in a nearby town. Yu-Sau was born with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:45.120
disability that makes one of his legs shorter than&nbsp;
the other. Yet, he was able to master martial art&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:50.880
techniques with hard work and dedication. 
Following that, Mo calls detective Luk saying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:55.760
that he has a lead. The police immediately come&nbsp;
to the town to receive him and make their way to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.760 --> 00:07:00.720
the killer’s hometown. They arrive at Yu-Sau’s&nbsp;
home but see that he has already moved away.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:05.840
The landlady claims that she never saw Yu-Sau do&nbsp;
anything other than train. He also used to rub&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:11.280
his face with salt until it bled to thicken&nbsp;
his skin so it could take a longer beating.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:15.920
Then, the police find writing on the wall&nbsp;
that says he has lost everything in his life,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:20.560
and now, his only motive is to fight the&nbsp;
best martial artists and be the number&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:25.520
one. That is why he has been killing some of&nbsp;
the best fighters and plans to kill more. 
&nbsp;

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:32.720
Meanwhile, Yu-Sau goes to his&nbsp;
next target, a former fighter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:38.480
and actor. This time, he challenges him to a&nbsp;
duel using swords. After a long and fierce match,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:44.000
Yu-Sau slits the man’s throat and kills&nbsp;
him. After yet another death, detective Luk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:49.120
is pressured by the higher officials to solve the&nbsp;
case sooner. She urges Mo to do the same but he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:54.640
seems to be hiding something from them. Once when&nbsp;
Mo was in prison, he got a letter from Yu-Sau that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.640 --> 00:08:00.320
vaguely talked about a challenge. Then, Mo didn’t&nbsp;
know what it meant, but now he has realized that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:06.560
he is the final person Yu-Sau wants to fight.
Detective Luk also starts to suspect Mo and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:11.680
asks the prison for the CCTV footage of every&nbsp;
meeting he has had with an outsider. At night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:16.640
Mo is sitting alone in his room when he remembers&nbsp;
the day before the first murder took place.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:20.160
Yu-Sau had sent him a letter&nbsp;
asking him to watch the news. 
&nbsp;

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:25.200
The following day, the police find out about&nbsp;
Yu-Sau’s current address and send a SWAT team to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:30.320
the house. They search around it but find no one&nbsp;
inside. Just as they are about to leave, they see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:35.120
that his wife’s ashes are still there which means&nbsp;
he will definitely return to retrieve them. 
&nbsp;

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:40.320
Detective Luk orders a redeploy and makes&nbsp;
the police stay hidden until Yu-Sau returns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:45.360
to the house. The next morning, he is seen&nbsp;
approaching the house on a boat. A flashback&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:50.000
shows that his wife was struggling severely&nbsp;
before her death. Yu-Sau couldn’t see her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:54.640
in such a condition anymore, so he mercy&nbsp;
killed her by strangling her to death. 
&nbsp;

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:02.720
In the present, the police see him and cautiously&nbsp;
wait for him to come closer so they can all attack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:08.240
at once. However, Yu-Sau notices guard dogs&nbsp;
around the neighborhood and takes a random turn.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:14.080
Before anyone knows where he went, he disappears.&nbsp;
Somewhere else, an officer investigating the CCTV&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:18.960
footage from the prison finds out that Yu-Sau&nbsp;
had come to meet Mo while he was in prison.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:23.840
Detective Luk points her gun at him, believing&nbsp;
that the killings were his and Yu-Sau's plan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:29.360
to get him out of the prison. Meanwhile, Sinn&nbsp;
Ying has set off to look for Yu-Sau on her own.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:35.200
Mo swiftly gets hold of the gun from detective&nbsp;
Luk and escapes to pursue Yu-Sau and his wife.
&nbsp;

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:41.360
At the same time, Sinn Ying and Yu-Sau meet&nbsp;
inside his house. She hands him his wife’s ashes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:47.440
asking him to leave her husband alone. However,&nbsp;
Yu-Sau believes that if he kills her, Mo will be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:52.720
even stronger. They get into a fight and Sinn&nbsp;
Ying, who is also a trained fighter gives him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:59.200
tough competition. But eventually, he stabs her in&nbsp;
the arm and runs away. Mo arrives to see his wife&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:05.280
on the floor and calls for help. He notices Yu-Sau&nbsp;
right outside the house and jumps to catch him.
&nbsp;

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:10.240
They land on a boat and the container with the&nbsp;
ashes breaks. While struggling, they fall into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:16.080
the river. Yu-Sau manages to get on top of another&nbsp;
boat and drive away. He eventually crashes to a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:22.160
boat with detective Luk and the police officers&nbsp;
but disappears soon after. Mo also runs away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:26.880
after making sure his wife will be saved. He&nbsp;
calls detective Luk and tells her that when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:33.760
he first got Yu-Sau’s letter, he thought he was&nbsp;
only a fan. Seeing his interest in martial arts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:38.800
Mo taught him everything he wanted to know while&nbsp;
he was still in prison. He was unaware that Yu-Sau&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:43.280
will use the knowledge to kill people. 
Mo also knew that Yu-Sau was going after Sinn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:47.120
Ying, and if he had told the police everything&nbsp;
from the beginning, they wouldn’t need his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:52.720
help. Hence, he kept the secret so he could come&nbsp;
outside the prison and save his wife himself.
&nbsp;

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:58.160
Mo knows who Yu-Sau’s next target is. Using the&nbsp;
information, he manages to find Yu-Sau in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:03.280
middle of a highway on his way to his target’s&nbsp;
house. Although Mo has a chance to run him over,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:08.000
he doesn’t do it because he wants to fight&nbsp;
him. Yu-Sau is delighted that his wish is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:12.960
finally coming true. The two join hands to&nbsp;
respect each other as opponents and start&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:17.600
the battle in the middle of the road. Almost&nbsp;
matching in strength and skills, they are not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:22.720
able to do any harm to each other for the first&nbsp;
few minutes. But then, when Yu-Sau gets tired,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:28.480
Mo slams him to the street where Yu-Sau is almost&nbsp;
hit by a vehicle. Following that, they get a hold&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:34.880
of bamboo sticks and fight using them. Eventually,&nbsp;
the bamboos also break, and they fist fight again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:40.160
Suddenly, Mo ends up under a car that drags&nbsp;
him a little further. It is enough to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:45.040
him go unconscious. Taking the opportunity, Yu-Sau&nbsp;
drags him to the other side of the road. 
&nbsp;

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:51.120
He is about to kill Mo but detective Luk arrives&nbsp;
at the right time and shoots him dead. In the end,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:56.400
Mo is taken to the hospital. Three months after&nbsp;
the incident, he is in prison again. Detective&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.400 --> 00:12:01.760
Luk comes for a visit and informs him that he&nbsp;
is being bailed shortly. In the last scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:07.520
we see Mo and Sinn Ying taking pictures with the&nbsp;
students from their school of martial arts. 
&nbsp;

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:10.720
Subscribe for more videos like&nbsp;
this, turn on the notification,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:14.320
and leave a like to help the channel&nbsp;
out. Thank You for watching.

